                                                "sense_id": "4e7f27ec-937f-3ed4-8795-a99cbadab4e4",
                                                "text": "In one word, be anything but a trifler, a trifler with God and your own soul. It was not for this, that God gave you “A mind superior to the vulgar herd.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
